  {
   "index": 16,
   "tag": "ul",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 564,
   "text": "Read on for the full story:\nE Ink Technology – A matte, paper-like finish that's easier on the eyes than a back-lit screen and remains glare-free, even in full sun.\n Longer Battery Life – Forget charging every night. E-readers have a battery that lasts days or even weeks on a single charge – not hours.\n Portable Design – Light enough to forget it's in your bag, comfortable enough to hold through a",
