   "tag": "p",
   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 284,
   "text": "The best eReader is a bit like choosing your favourite book – everyone has a different answer. Whether you're a busy professional who makes the most of their commute or a late-night reader who can't put a book down, there's an eBook reader for your habits and budget at Harvey Norman.",
