   "landmarks": [
    "main"
   ],
   "textLength": 337,
   "text": "The reading list:\nKobo – Compact, lightweight and gloriously glare-free, shop the Clara for everyday reading, the Libra for one-handed comfort, or the Elipsa for a bigger canvas.\n Onyx Boox – From the pocket-sized Boox Palma to the note-taking Boox Note Air, academic reading, sketching and advanced annotation are all part of the story.",
